window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Celestial Rulers need human women to prevent the destruction of their alien civilization. Their human agents, working nonstop to recruit suitable mates, will stop at nothing to accomplish their purpose. That purpose is simple. Pair beautiful, fertile women with multiple extraterrestrial men.</p> <p>Reverse harems like you’ve never seen before in the sexy new alien breeding reverse harem romance series, Harem of the Celestial Conquerors Series. Each of these books is a standalone, start-to-finish, HEA romance but there are characters common to the stories. Though it isn’t necessary, you’ll probably enjoy this series more by listening to the books in order.</p> <p>This collection includes:</p> <p><i>Claimed by Celestial Alien Rulers</i></p> <p><i>Chosen by the Cosmic Kings</i></p> <p><i>Bound to Galactic Alien Overlords</i></p> <p><i>Conquered by Alien Celestial Lords</i></p> <p><i>Desired by Interstellar Alien Emperors</i></p> <p>Don’t miss this alien romance series that listeners are already talking about.</p>"; 
